  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="225f19db-7679-5e96-817e-6aff1def1172" activityNameId="9d0df241-ba7a-59e5-8ed2-cf3ab45384f4" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Ventilation equipment, decentralized, 180-250 m3/h, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Ventilation equipment, decentralized, 180-250 m3/h, at plant
Production of a typical component used for a decentral ventilation system in a multi family house. The house considered in the investigation includes 6 flats with 130 m2 floor area each and a ventilation rate of 120 m3/h.;
UUID: c25055c0-9d4e-330e-8b97-e53ec820c533
Materials used for the production. Estimation of electricity use for the different production steps. Energy use for heating of the production building. Transport of raw materials to the plant. Estimation for the Infrastructure of the Production site included.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Ventilation unit for decentral ventilation systems with 120 m3/h average air flow. Average of four different ventilation units with 180-250 m3/h maximal air flow considered. Housing mainly made of galvanised steel. Total weight of component 43.1 kg
Time period: Materials investigated in 2003
Production volume: na
Sampling: Questionnaire and technical information of four producer used. Average data of four common products used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c25055c0-9d4e-330e-8b97-e53ec820c533.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
